### Health probes. Open in VS Code with the REST Client extension, or in a JetBrains IDE.
### Start the API first: pnpm --filter @orderpilot/api dev
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Liveness: the process is up. Never touches the database.
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Readiness: 200 when every registered check is up, 503 when one is down.
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Health: build, environment, uptime and the checks.
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Send your own request id: it comes back in X-Request-Id and in every log line.
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
X-Request-Id: my-first-request-001
